     [2m[38;5;231m  96 [0m[38;5;231m - `Event.type` is one of `status`, `due-date`, `due`, `overdue`.[39m
     [38;5;77m[48;5;22m  97 +[38;5;231m- `Event.before` / `Event.after` carry the old and new value of the field the                         [39m[49m
     [38;5;77m[48;5;22m  98 +[38;5;231m  event names: task status for `status`, `dueAt` for `due-date`. For the                              [39m[49m
     [38;5;77m[48;5;22m  99 +[38;5;231m  time-triggered `due` and `overdue` events no field changed, so `before` is                          [39m[49m
     [38;5;77m[48;5;22m 100 +[38;5;231m  `null` and `after` is the `dueAt` that elapsed.                                                     [39m[49m
     [2m[38;5;231m 101 [0m[38;5;231m - `Event.seq` is monotonic within the log and defines ordering.[39m
